  "reason": "Unselected compatibility-conflicting repair. Current approved source d222d3cf/version2.0.0 accepts literal integer seeds, including negative seeds supported by public runtime.generate. Proposed ab882fbc/version2.0.1 adds useful literal-call validation but rejects negative seeds and changes VERSION passed to GenCtx. stable_rng hashes VERSION, so the version bump changes the keyed random stream; the claimed preservation of lawful generated grids is not established. Rebase the validation to retain the existing seed domain and RNG version, or explicitly justify and verify a deliberate sampling migration. Current malformed-scalar weakness is not claimed fixed. Retain the row/column rule prototype, reported12/12 battery,15 portable/fresh tests,48 Racket labels and24 rotations solely with proposed bytes; no current prototype count, source/rule modification, approval upgrade or owner submitted-code execution.",
